/* 本次反馈（Figma 647:1306）：青瓷“先接住这次感受”；核对；情绪概览数据格；互动线索；今天先做（唯一实心）；也可以选择。
   高风险时顶部浅红提示，“查看安全指引”为唯一实心按钮，不显示互动线索和训练。 */
page {
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.feedback-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 16rpx var(--p3-page-x) calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: var(--p3-paper);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.feedback-risk {
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.feedback-risk__note {
  display: block;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.feedback-risk__actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  margin-top: 8rpx;
}

.feedback-hold {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  padding: var(--p3-card);
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-card);
  background: var(--p3-soft);
}

.feedback-hold__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.feedback-hold__art {
  width: 96rpx;
  height: 96rpx;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.feedback-hold__title {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-family: var(--p3-font-serif);
  font-size: 48rpx;
  line-height: 64rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
}

.feedback-hold__body {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
}

.feedback-section {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  min-width: 0;
}

.feedback-cells {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.feedback-cell {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
  padding: 28rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

/* 数值来自接口，可能是任意文字，用系统衬线避免与子集混排。 */
.feedback-cell__value {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-family: var(--p3-font-serif-open);
  font-size: 48rpx;
  line-height: 64rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.feedback-cell__label {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.feedback-trigger {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.feedback-clue {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8rpx;
  padding: 28rpx 0;
}

.feedback-clue--divided {
  box-shadow: inset 0 -2rpx 0 var(--p3-hairline);
}

.feedback-clue__title {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 32rpx;
  line-height: 48rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.feedback-clue__text {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.feedback-today {
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.feedback-today__kicker,
.feedback-today__reason {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.feedback-today__title {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 40rpx;
  line-height: 56rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.feedback-today__body {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.feedback-row {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  text-align: left;
}
